      "message": "This calls across (another) Binder, so the phone process is seeing the carrier privileges check for the system server. This was never going to work. I probably approved this code and missed the check, but this isn\u0027t a bug. If anything though, we should probably have some kind of a safety inside of TM#hasCarrierPrivileges() to catch these and/or always return false for system server since it should *never* rely on carrier privileges.\n\nCould you file a bug for that?\n\nBtw, if we were using CarrierPrivilegesTracker, then the cache could be client-side, not require a binder call, and then this would work. :-)",
